// R5 lane PAR-MARGIN-2 (item 3 under process_orders_on_close): one leveraged long (margin 20, 4.785 x equity)
// placed and filled at the close of the signal bar 2025-04-02 20:00 UTC and carried into the next bar, which
// first crosses the maintenance line at an early 1-minute low and reaches a deeper low later.
// process_orders_on_close ON, magnifier OFF. Timeout close 3 bars after the entry bar.
//@version=6
strategy("pm2-i3-pooc-chart-0402-2000", overlay=true, initial_capital=1000,
     default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1, pyramiding=1,
     margin_long=20, margin_short=20, commission_value=0, slippage=0,
     process_orders_on_close=true)
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 2, 20, 0) and strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = math.floor(4.785 * strategy.equity / close * 1000) / 1000)
if strategy.position_size > 0 and bar_index - strategy.opentrades.entry_bar_index(0) >= 3
    strategy.close("L", comment="timeout")
